  "scope": "Phase 4 two-option selection plus the requested Phase 5 chat display. The Phase 5 citation checker is separate work.",
  "changes": [
    "Five parallel Qwen samples at temperature 0.7 select only code-built eligible operation/parameter-choice pairs.",
    "One n=5 HTTP request preserves account concurrency limits; maximum output reservation covers all five samples and reported usage settles once.",
    "Code merges votes, reads operation-token logprobs, penalizes missing arguments and ranks two distinct cards. Unsampled alternatives are honestly Low.",
    "High thresholds require matching model, server, operation catalog and calibration evidence. Both Low produces one saved open question.",
    "All native parameters are exposed for review/editing; edits are schema checked and every selected workflow passes native validation before execution.",
    "High preselection never runs. Selected multi-step workflows preserve dependencies under untouched nullable defaults, and explicit edits override planned values.",
    "Chat avoids duplicate replies and fact-title prefixes, shows short chosen/validated traces, and moves full planning traces to Activity.",
    "Working notes are collapsed and labelled unchecked; only admins in Expert mode can display them. REST and websocket delivery redact note text for non-admins."
  ],
